>smart</span><span begin="00:13.530" end="00:13.530">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.530" end="00:16.800"><span begin="00:13.530" end="00:13.680">All </span><span begin="00:13.680" end="00:13.800">it </span><span begin="00:13.800" end="00:14.280">takes</span><span begin="00:14.280" end="00:14.280">, </span><span begin="00:14.280" end="00:14.400">is </span><span begin="00:14.400" end="00:14.460">a </span><span begin="00:14.460" end="00:14.940">spark</span><span begin="00:14.940" end="00:14.940">, </span><span begin="00:14.940" end="00:15.150">to </span><span begin="00:15.150" end="00:15.660">ignite </span><span begin="00:15.660" end="00:15.810">my </span><span begin="00:15.810" end="00:16.080">bad </span><span begin="00:16.080" end="00:16.680">intentions</span><span begin="00:16.680" end="00:16.800">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.800" end="00:18.510"><span begin="00:16.800" end="00:16.980">And </span><span begin="00:16.980" end="00:17.100">do </span><span begin="00:17.100" end="00:17.340">what </span><span begin="00:17.340" end="00:17.460">I </span><span begin="00:17.460" end="00:17.610">do </span><span begin="00:17.610" end="00:17.880">best </span><span begin="00:17.880" end="00:17.940">to </span><span begin="00:17.940" end="00:18.150">your </span><span begin="00:18.150" end="00:18.510">heart</span><span begin="00:18.510" end="00:18.510">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.510" end="00:20.790"><span begin="00:18.510" end="00:18.750">Don't </span><span begin="00:18.750" end="00:18.870">be </span><span begin="00:18.870" end="00:19.380">fooled</span><span begin="00:19.380" end="00:19.380">, </span><span begin="00:19.380" end="00:19.470">I </span><span begin="00:19.470" end="00:19.650">was </span><span begin="00:19.650" end="00:20.070">raised </span><span begin="00:20.070" end="00:20.220">by </span><span begin="00:20.220" end="00:20.340">the </span><span begin="00:20.340" end="00:20.790">wolves</span><span begin="00:20.790" end="00:20.790">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.790" end="00:22.170"><span begin="00:20.790" end="00:20.940">Now </span><span begin="00:20.940" end="00:21.060">the </span><span begin="00:21.060" end="00:21.480">moon </span><span begin="00:21.480" end="00:21.720">hangs </span><span begin="00:21.720" end="00:21.810">in </span><span begin="00:21.810" end="00:22.170">full</span><span begin="00:22.170" end="00:22.170">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.170" end="00:24.120"><span begin="00:22.170" end="00:22.350">so </span><span begin="00:22.350" end="00:22.530">you </span><span begin="00:22.530" end="00:22.980">know </span><span begin="00:22.980" end="00:23.070">I </span><span begin="00:23.070" end="00:23.460">won't </span><span begin="00:23.460" end="00:23.700">play </span><span begin="00:23.700" end="00:23.850">by </span><span begin="00:23.850" end="00:23.940">the </span><span begin="00:23.940" end="00:24.120">rules</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.120" end="00:24.120"><span begin="00:24.120" end="00:24.120">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.120" end="00:27.600"><span begin="00:24.120" end="00:24.750">I </span><span begin="00:24.750" end="00:25.410">will </span><span begin="00:25.410" end="00:26.700">never </span><span begin="00:26.700" end="00:27.600">spill</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.600" end="00:29.700"><span begin="00:27.600" end="00:28.050">Spill </span><span begin="00:28.050" end="00:28.380">my </span><span begin="00:28.380" end="00:28.770">blood </span><span begin="00:28.770" end="00:28.980">for </span><span begin="00:28.980" end="00:29.700">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.700" end="00:32.670"><span begin="00:29.700" end="00:30.330">You </span><span begin="00:30.330" end="00:31.020">have </span><span begin="00:31.020" end="00:31.590">let </span><span begin="00:31.590" end="00:32.430">me </span><span begin="00:32.430" end="00:32.670">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.210" end="00:35.790"><span begin="00:33.210" end="00:33.660">One </span><span begin="00:33.660" end="00:34.020">too </span><span begin="00:34.020" end="00:34.500">many </span><span begin="00:34.500" end="00:35.790">times</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.790" end="00:35.790"><span begin="00:35.790" end="00:35.790">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.790" end="00:38.610"><span begin="00:35.790" end="00:36.480">Someway</span><span begin="00:36.480" end="00:36.480">, </span><span begin="00:36.480" end="00:37.200">somehow</span><span begin="00:37.200" end="00:37.200">, </span><span begin="00:37.200" end="00:37.470">we've </span><span begin="00:37.470" end="00:38.220">fallen </span><span begin="00:38.220" end="00:38.610">out</span><span begin="00:38.610" end="00:38.610">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.610" end="00:41.700"><span begin="00:38.610" end="00:39.120">Caught </span><span begin="00:39.120" end="00:39.390">in </span><span begin="00:39.390" end="00:40.110">between </span><span begin="00:40.110" end="00:40.380">my </span><span begin="00:40.380" end="00:41.700">enemies</span><span begin="00:41.700" end="00:41.700">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.700" end="00:44.340"><span begin="00:41.700" end="00:41.790">No </span><span begin="00:41.790" end="00:42.180">way </span><span begin="00:42.180" end="00:42.540">not </span><span begin="00:42.540" end="00:42.960">now</span><span begin="00:42.960" end="00:42.960">, </span><span begin="00:42.960" end="00:43.110">I </span><span begin="00:43.110" end="00:43.410">won't </span><span begin="00:43.410" end="00:43.770">back </span><span begin="00:43.770" end="00:44.340">down</span><span begin="00:44.340" end="00:44.340">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.340" end="00:47.490"><span begin="00:44.340" end="00:44.610">I </span><span begin="00:44.610" end="00:45.030">draw </span><span begin="00:45.030" end="00:45.360">the </span><span begin="00:45.360" end="00:45.810">line </span><span begin="00:45.810" end="00:45.930">at </span><spa